&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;webgoat-a-deliberately-insecure-web-application&#34;&gt;WebGoat: A deliberately insecure Web Application
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/WebGoat/WebGoat/actions/workflows/build.yml&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
